# Shadow DOM

Shadow DOM — изолированное DOM-дерево внутри элемента. Используется в React, Vue, Angular.

## Shadow Root

```java
WebElement host = driver.findElement(By.id("my-element"));
WebElement shadowRoot = (WebElement) ((JavascriptExecutor) driver)
    .executeScript("return arguments[0].shadowRoot", host);
WebElement inner = shadowRoot.findElement(By.id("inner-button"));
```

## Чередование light и shadow DOM

```java
// host → shadow → shadow → element
WebElement level1 = (WebElement) ((JavascriptExecutor) driver)
    .executeScript("return arguments[0].shadowRoot", host);
WebElement level2 = (WebElement) ((JavascriptExecutor) driver)
    .executeScript("return arguments[0].shadowRoot", level1);
WebElement target = level2.findElement(By.cssSelector("button"));
```

## Кастомный locator для Shadow DOM

```java
public WebElement findShadowElement(WebDriver driver, String hostSelector, String innerSelector) {
    WebElement host = driver.findElement(By.cssSelector(hostSelector));
    WebElement shadow = (WebElement) ((JavascriptExecutor) driver)
        .executeScript("return arguments[0].shadowRoot", host);
    return shadow.findElement(By.cssSelector(innerSelector));
}
```

## К практике

### findShadowElement
Найди элемент внутри shadow DOM.

```java
WebElement host = driver.findElement(By.id("host"));
WebElement shadow = (WebElement) ((JavascriptExecutor) driver)
    .executeScript("return arguments[0].shadowRoot", host);
return shadow.findElement(By.id("inner")).getText();
```

### clickShadowButton
Найди и кликни кнопку внутри shadow DOM.

```java
WebElement host = driver.findElement(By.id("host"));
WebElement shadow = (WebElement) ((JavascriptExecutor) driver)
    .executeScript("return arguments[0].shadowRoot", host);
shadow.findElement(By.cssSelector("button.primary")).click();
```

